{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JZ7wfWnKh1anq3uw8CXZR8","type":"tool_result","content":"# OpenVM v2 Gist Content\n\nThis GitHub Gist by leonardoalt contains documentation and resources for OpenVM v2, a virtual machine project. The gist includes:\n\n## Main Sections:\n\n**Paper Reference:** Links to the OpenVM v2 research paper at openvm.dev/swirl.pdf\n\n**GPU Experiments:** Performance metrics and analysis for two cryptographic operations:\n- Keccak hashing with metrics viewer and APC (AutoPrecompile) analysis\n- Pairing operations with corresponding metrics and APC data\n\n**CPU Experiments:** Similar experimental data for both Keccak and Pairing operations, including metrics visualization and APC candidate analysis\n\n**Technical Resources:** References to CUDA programming materials and GPU profiling tools:\n- \"CUDA Programming Guide\" from NVIDIA documentation\n- NVIDIA Nsight Systems and Nsight Compute profilers\n\nThe gist serves as a hub directing to various analysis dashboards hosted on GitHub Gists, using the powdr-labs metrics viewer and autoprecompile analyzer for performance evaluation across different hardware configurations."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_013x2pdiPdVkJG9crsTqW4th","session_id":"8c7f624f-3476-4fc9-b97f-853499dc45e9","uuid":"dfecd57b-89f9-4d2c-9874-ea1ab0422d25","timestamp":"2026-04-10T18:32:49.080Z"}
