{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ACVhHyb1hoVfVUeRs8T9Q9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No source code modifications -- clean working tree. \n\n## Summary\n\n**Current state after 2 previous optimizations:**\n| Metric | APC 0 | APC 100 | APC 300 | vs Baseline (APC 300) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| STARK excl trace | 2147ms | 2004ms | 2205ms | -273ms (-11.0%) |\n| Round 0 | 174ms | 382ms | 570ms | -93ms |\n| Stacked Reduction | 101ms | 127ms | 148ms | -160ms |\n\n**Selected optimization: Batch Round 0 coset-parallel kernel launches**\n\nRound 0 is the worst-scaling component (+396ms from APC 0 to APC 300). At APC 300, ~935 tiny kernel launches (3-12 thread blocks each) run sequentially on the GPU, utilizing only 3-11% of SM capacity per launch. By batching small AIRs into single kernel launches using per-AIR metadata (a `blockIdx.z` dimension), we can achieve 2-4x better GPU throughput for these kernels, saving an estimated 150-300ms at APC 300.\n\nTask written to `autoopt-results/task.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_read_input_tokens":113698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c7f624f-3476-4fc9-b97f-853499dc45e9","uuid":"ae41e2b8-962e-44c3-b91a-90bae24f977e"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1232309,"duration_api_ms":1208441,"num_turns":67,"result":"No source code modifications -- clean working tree. \n\n## Summary\n\n**Current state after 2 previous optimizations:**\n| Metric | APC 0 | APC 100 | APC 300 | vs Baseline (APC 300) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| STARK excl trace | 2147ms | 2004ms | 2205ms | -273ms (-11.0%) |\n| Round 0 | 174ms | 382ms | 570ms | -93ms |\n| Stacked Reduction | 101ms | 127ms | 148ms | -160ms |\n\n**Selected optimization: Batch Round 0 coset-parallel kernel launches**\n\nRound 0 is the worst-scaling component (+396ms from APC 0 to APC 300). At APC 300, ~935 tiny kernel launches (3-12 thread blocks each) run sequentially on the GPU, utilizing only 3-11% of SM capacity per launch. By batching small AIRs into single kernel launches using per-AIR metadata (a `blockIdx.z` dimension), we can achieve 2-4x better GPU throughput for these kernels, saving an estimated 150-300ms at APC 300.\n\nTask written to `autoopt-results/task.md`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8c7f624f-3476-4fc9-b97f-853499dc45e9","total_cost_usd":4.0901955999999995,"usage":{"input_tokens":55,"cache_creation_input_tokens":104041,"cache_read_input_tokens":3132019,"output_tokens":48130,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":104041,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":304,"cache_read_input_tokens":113698,"cache_creation_input_tokens":334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":334},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6[1m]":{"inputTokens":55,"outputTokens":48130,"cacheReadInputTokens":3132019,"cacheCreationInputTokens":104041,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":3.4197907499999993,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6340,